OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks and fancy dress bring
OL,4,ADerry's 40th Halloween celebrations to
OL,5,Aclose
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 40th anniversary of Londonderry's
OL,8,FHalloween festival has come to a
OL,9,Fspectacular close, with a carnival
OL,10,Fparade and fireworks display lighting
OL,11,Fup the skies over the River Foyle.
OL,13,FFrom its humble beginnings in the
OL,14,F1980s, the festival has grown to become
OL,15,Fwhat organisers have called Europe's
OL,16,Flargest Halloween celebration.
OL,18,FThis year, Derry marked four decades of
OL,19,Fthe festival with events inspired by
OL,20,Ffolklore, mythology and the traditions
OL,21,Fof Samhain, the ancient Celtic festival
OL,22,Ffrom which Halloween has its roots.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
