OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks and fancy dress bring
OL,4,ADerry's 40th Halloween celebrations to
OL,5,Aclose
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow a major fixture in the city's
OL,8,Fcalendar, the final day of the festival
OL,9,Fattracted visitors from around the
OL,10,Fworld, who joined in the celebrations
OL,11,Fwith all of the ghosts, ghouls and
OL,12,Fgoblins.
